OL,3,ABurnham says UK net migration now under
OL,4,A'sufficient' control
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservatives said the fall was
OL,7,F"mainly a result of changes" they made
OL,8,Fin government, while Reform UK said the
OL,9,Ffigures were "no cause for
OL,10,Fcelebration".
